<title>MEXICO: Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.08 pct.</title>
<headline>Mexico's TIIE 28-day rate falls to 31.08 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's 28-day interbank interest rate fell 123.50 basis points to 31.08 percent on Wednesday, from 32.3150 percent on Tuesday, Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>THE TIIP fell 90.64 basis points to 30.9957 percent on Wednesday from 31.9021 percent the week before.</p>
<p>The TIIE is a market-weighted average interbank rate that is replacing the TIIP, an average interbank rate.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom 525 7289558</p>
</text>
